WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.500
The Desk's advantage is not model prose. It owns
deterministic transaction mechanics and versioned judgment.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
AtlasGrid's selected two-hundred-ten-million-dollar structure
clears the twenty-two-percent hurdle at 23.3 percent.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Restoring the seller's two-hundred-forty-million-dollar ask
drops returns to 17.6 percent and preserves REPRICE.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
A new deal begins with sources, not a chat window. This
four-file synthetic package is validated in the browser

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.000
before any return conclusion appears, and company
thresholds cannot become fund policy.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.500
Northstar clears mechanical intake, but not investment quality.
Its 83.6 percent retention proxy spans eleven months,

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:37.000
so it cannot clear a separate 95 percent annual NRR screen.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:42.000
The analyst can inspect the exact customer periods
and dollar rows behind that proxy.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Lineage connects evidence to the output
and the blocking decision condition.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Human judgment stays explicit. A named analyst records
a renewal-risk observation; seven unresolved diligence

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:57.000
and policy gates continue to block advancement.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.500
Model review is deliberately secondary. The user selects the
exact retention evidence and confirms what leaves the browser.

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.000
The reviewer returns cited objections as proposed language,
never a changed book or recommendation.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:18.000
A named human accepts, rejects, or edits the proposal. The
disposition preserves evidence references and cannot

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.000
change finance, policy, issues, or approval. The memo combines
deterministic economics, analyst judgment, and accepted model

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.000
language with provenance. It remains a synthetic working draft,
and the IC decision is pending.
